# Subway Train: "When this Vehicle enters, you may pay {G}. If you do, search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand,
# then shuffle." Bot1 casts it for {2} (Mox Pearl, Mox Jet), then Mox Emerald's {G} is in the pool when the trigger resolves and Bot1 pays:
